### Requests for IntelliJ HTTP Client or VS Code "REST Client".
### Start the app first: ./gradlew bootRun inside the Nix shell (dev profile seeds demo data),
### or ./gradlew bootRun --args='--spring.profiles.active=dev' outside it.

@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Dry run: spelling variant of the demo partner "Acme Chemicals GmbH" -> duplicate with score 1.0
POST {{host}}/api/v1/business-partners/checks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ACME Chemicals G.m.b.H.",
  "address": {"street": "Industriestr. 1", "postalCode": "10115", "city": "Berlin", "country": "DE"}
}

### 2. Onboard a new Polish company -> 201 Created (VAT ID is compacted to PL5261040828)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/business-partners
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Przykład Software sp. z o.o.",
  "address": {"street": "ul. Testowa 2", "postalCode": "30-002", "city": "Kraków", "country": "PL"},
  "vatId": "PL 526-104-08-28"
}

### 3a. Same name as a demo partner, same city, other postal code -> 409 (score 0.85*1.0 + 0.15*0.7 = 0.955)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/business-partners
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Przykład Logistyka S.A.",
  "address": {"street": "ul. Inna 5", "postalCode": "31-002", "city": "Krakow", "country": "PL"}
}

### 3b. Same name in another city -> 201 created, but listed in possibleDuplicates (score 0.85)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/business-partners
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Przykład Logistyka S.A.",
  "address": {"street": "ul. Głogowska 7", "postalCode": "60-001", "city": "Poznań", "country": "PL"}
}

### 4. Same VAT ID as a demo partner -> 409 Conflict (SAME_VAT_ID)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/business-partners
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Completely Different Name GmbH",
  "address": {"street": "Hauptstraße 1", "postalCode": "10115", "city": "Berlin", "country": "DE"},
  "vatId": "DE136695976"
}

### 5. Everything wrong -> 422 with all violations
POST {{host}}/api/v1/business-partners
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Broken Corp",
  "address": {"city": "Berlin", "postalCode": "1234", "country": "DE"},
  "vatId": "DE136695977",
  "iban": "CH9300762011623852957"
}

### 6. List partners in Poland
GET {{host}}/api/v1/business-partners?country=PL

### 7. Unknown id -> 404 problem
GET {{host}}/api/v1/business-partners/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. Malformed JSON -> 400 problem
POST {{host}}/api/v1/business-partners
Content-Type: application/json

{not json
